---
import { SITE_METADATA } from '../data/navigation';
---

<section class="relative pt-12 pb-16 md:pt-20 md:pb-24 overflow-hidden text-center">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Top badge -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-950/70 border border-cyan-800/60 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-medium mb-6 shadow-sm shadow-cyan-950">
      <span class="text-base">🚀</span>
      <span>2025/2026 年度稳定高速机场实测排行榜</span>
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
      <span class="text-slate-400">持续更新中</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Headline -->
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight md:leading-tight">
      真测速 · 拒绝虚标
      <br />
      <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 via-teal-300 to-blue-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
        为你挑选最适合的高速稳定机场
      </span>
    </h1>

    <!-- Subtitle -->
    <p class="mt-6 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      告别晚高峰卡顿、频繁掉线与流媒体封锁。本站严选运营 3 年以上老牌专线，
      覆盖 <strong class="text-white font-semibold">IPLC/IEPL 旗舰专线</strong>、<strong class="text-white font-semibold">平价学生性价比</strong> 与 <strong class="text-white font-semibold">不限时长按量计费</strong>。
    </p>

    <!-- Trust Stats Grid -->
    <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 sm:gap-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800/80 backdrop-blur-sm">
        <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-cyan-400">20:00~23:00</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">晚高峰硬核实测</div>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800/80 backdrop-blur-sm">
        <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-teal-400">100%</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">真内网专线不过墙</div>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800/80 backdrop-blur-sm">
        <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-blue-400">4K / 8K</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">油管/奈飞毫秒秒开</div>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800/80 backdrop-blur-sm">
        <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-amber-400">AI 解锁</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">ChatGPT/Claude 双全解</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick CTAs -->
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="#airports-section"
        class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-blue-600 text-white shadow-lg shadow-cyan-500/25 hover:shadow-cyan-500/40 hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98] transition-all"
      >
        👇 快速查看精选推荐
      </a>
      <a
        href="#comparison-section"
        class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm bg-slate-900 text-slate-200 border border-slate-700/80 hover:bg-slate-800 hover:text-white transition-all"
      >
        📊 横向参数对比表
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
